---
import NeuronExplorer from "./NeuronExplorer.astro";
---

<section class="hero" id="about" aria-labelledby="hero-name">
  <NeuronExplorer />
  <div class="shell hero-inner">
    <h1 id="hero-name">Mranmay <em>Shetty</em></h1>
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="hero-intro">
        I’m a research assistant in <a href="https://rossilab.iit.it/">Federico Rossi’s lab</a>
        at the Istituto Italiano di Tecnologia (IIT) in Rovereto. I use MICrONS to study
        which visual inputs reach different branches of a neuron in mouse visual cortex.
      </p>
      <p>
        I also collaborate with <a href="https://kreimanlab.com/">Gabriel Kreiman</a>
        at Harvard Medical School on computational models of visual working memory.
      </p>
      <p>
        During my MSc at the University of Côte d’Azur, I worked with
        <a href="https://laurentperrinet.github.io/">Laurent Perrinet</a> and
        <a href="https://team.inria.fr/biovision/bruno-cessac/">Bruno Cessac</a>
        on spike inference, and with Bruno on retinal computation. Before that,
        I worked on applied AI with <a href="https://scaai.edu.in/faculty">Rahee Walambe</a>
        at the <a href="https://scaai.edu.in/">Symbiosis Centre for Applied Artificial Intelligence</a> in Pune. My Erdős number is 3.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-links">
      <a class="button solid" href="/cv/">View CV</a>
      <a class="button quiet" href="/#publications">Selected publications</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
